# RSX dotfiles ignore list
#
# Paths inside rsx/dotfiles/ that should NOT be synced into the ISO
# (runtime data, caches, databases, logs, ...).
#
# - Each line starts with a manifest <name>, e.g.  docker/jellyfin/cache/
# - sync-dotfiles.sh skips these (and removes them from the ISO copy if present)
# - Lines ending with / are folders: rsx-setup creates them EMPTY on deploy,
#   owned by the user, so containers running as 1000:1000 can write to them
#   (otherwise docker creates them as root)
# - Lines starting with # are ignored.

# --- docker: app data the containers generate themselves ---
docker/jellyfin/config/
docker/jellyfin/cache/
docker/audioBookShelf/config/
docker/audioBookShelf/metadata/
docker/homepage/config/logs/
